  "details": "What do you mean, in order for props to respawn, I need to add VRC Object Sync? What if I don't want my prop to sync?\n\nAnd what if I want it to respawn if nobody's touched it for 5 minutes?\n\nI made a user script that respawns props after 5 minutes and makes them temporarily Kinematic until grabbed again so I can place them in stacks and they don't break if they respawn out of order, but I'm sure I did it wrong somehow. networking is hard.\n\nAnd honestly I think it would be cool if edible pickups was a native feature.\n\nI like those worlds where you can eat a prop and it goes through several partially-eaten stages and plays a sound, but I really don't want to have to implement all that myself.\n\nAnd I've heard from other creators that people have made more optimized object syncing too? Honestly I think pickups are kinda left behind tech-wise. I think it's about time.",
